Read the target project's actual files, Git state, installed tools, and existing V2 documentation. Determine whether a verified V2 recipe already exists. This request has no verified recipe, so research is required. Use current primary sources: one official approach and at most two maintained alternatives. Check official documentation, maintained GitHub repositories, and concrete success or failure evidence. General web sources are supporting evidence only. Do not install anything, implement the feature, create a Preview, alter the target project, edit run.yml, or write outside the Run directory.

Create exactly these three non-empty files:
